# This file exists so the `data/` directory is tracked by git before the

# corpus is downloaded.

#

# The data/ directory is the canonical home for the raw corpus:

# - Bare-act PDFs at the top level: bns_2023.pdf, ipc_1860.pdf, bnss_2023.pdf

# - Judgment HTML+PDF pairs in numbered subfolders: 01/, 02/, ..., 70/

#

# See ../sources.yaml for the manifest and ../ingestion/collect/README.md

# for the download playbook.

#

# data/ IS committed to the repo (the raw corpus is part of the deliverable).

# chroma_db/ is gitignored (it is a build artifact, rebuilt by `make ingest`).
